Geography", "description": "The geographic data used in redistricting includes the census geography used as building blocks for districts, the county election precincts used to collect and report voter and election returns data, and other geographic areas used for reference, such as cities and school districts.", "image_display_url": "https://data.capitol.texas.gov/uploads/group/2021-08-17-231141.506217redticongeography.svg", "title": "Geography", "id": "730a64b5-f70a-463d-ba87-a875cde6482f", "name": "geography"}], "license_id": "cc-by", "relationships_as_subject": [], "organization": {"description": "", "created": "2019-10-04T11:59:14.663107", "title": "Texas Legislative Council", "name": "tlc", "is_organization": true, "state": "active", "image_url": "https://data.capitol.texas.gov/base/images/tlc-logo.png", "revision_id": "ced4f2d5-7e15-4115-8c24-2fd1ebe9274b", "type": "organization", "id": "eb7dd023-f166-4613-92ff-b6b3d5c026c6", "approval_status": "approved"}, "name": "2020-census-geography", "isopen": true, "url": "", "notes": "The United States Census Bureau publishes geographic units used for tabulation of\r\nthe 2020 Census population data in the 2020 TIGER/Line Shapefile. The geographic\r\nunits, which remain constant throughout the decade, include counties, census tracts,\r\nblock groups, and blocks. Fields have been added so data formatted or published\r\nby the council can be joined to the shapefile for analysis.\r\n\r\nEach Shapefile (.shp) is in a compressed file (.zip) format.\r\n\r\n* Blocks.zip - Census Blocks\r\n* BlockGroups.zip - Block Groups\r\n* Tracts.zip - Census Tracts\r\n* Counties.zip - Counties\r\n* Cities.zip - Census Places (Cities)\r\n* CDPs.zip - Census Designated Places\r\n\r\nEach 'Pop' file contains the 2020 Census population for the corresponding geographic level.\r\n\r\n* BlocksPop.zip - Census Blocks 2020 Census Population\r\n* BlockGroupPop.zip - Census Block Groups 2020 Census Population\r\n* TractsPop.zip - Census Tracts 2020 Census Population\r\n* CountiesPop.zip - Counties 2020 Census Population", "owner_org": "eb7dd023-f166-4613-92ff-b6b3d5c026c6", "extras": [], "license_url": "http://www.opendefinition.org/licenses/cc-by", "title": "2020 Census Geography", "revision_id": "2e0dd6a3-e608-4c36-bc78-f8255d8ead65"}}